Contribution of the other outcomes to the achievement outcome 2.1
Outcome 1 will create increased employment opportunities providing beneficiaries with income to facilitate their use of and access to quality basic social services;
Outcome 2.2 will ensure an equitable access to these basic social while reflecting greater gender equality and youth empowerment;
Outcome 3 will ensure that there are effective policies and efficient public institutions at national, regional and local levels to deliver quality basic social services to the population, including youth, women and vulnerable groups;
Outcome 4 will enable the populations benefitting from basic social services to live in a healthier and more sustainable environment with the capacity to be resilient to shocks.
